title: loadPhase
---
<<declare $minigame_won = false>>
<<declare $knows_james_name = false>>
<<declare $asked_daisy_book = false>>
<<declare $asked_kevin_writing = false>>
<<declare $kevin_won = false>>
<<declare $kevin_done = false>>
<<declare $diana_won = false>>
<<declare $diana_done = false>>
<<declare $daniel_won = false>>
<<declare $daniel_done = false>>
<<declare $sammy_won = false>>
<<declare $sammy_done = false>>
===

title: Viviana_Bully_Start
---
*Viviana stands beside the sandbox, cardboard sword in hand, cardboard helmet on top, She fiddles with the sand with her sword*
*She notices you walking towards her, she points the sword towards you*

Viviana : Who are you!

Lola : Oh um I'm Lola.
Viviana : Lola? Never heard of you.
Viviana : I’m Viviana, Everyone knows me.
<<jump Viviana_Bully_Questions>> 
===

title: Viviana_Bully_Questions
---
-> Lola : Why do you have a sword? 
    Viviana : Can’t you tell?
    Viviana : I’m a knight!
    Viviana : I’m the fastest so I get the sword.
    *She starts to poke the air rapidly*
    Viviana : Hah! See that? That's why I’m a knight and you’re not!
-> Lola : I bet I’m faster than you
    Viviana : Hah! As if. 
    Lola: Yeah I am! 
    Viviana : No you’re not! I bet you’re not even faster than me in Drop Grab
    Lola : What’s Drop Grab?
    Viviana : You have to grab before I do? Obviously.
Viviana: Play it with me right now! I know you’re not faster.
<<set $minigame_won to false>>
<<start_minigame MinigameManager "marbles">>
<<jump Viviana_Bully_MidPoint>>
===

title: Viviana_Bully_MidPoint
---
<<if $minigame_won>>
    Viviana : No no no! Again!
    Lola  : But I won.
    Viviana : No that's not fair!! Again!
    Lola  : Fine but you have to give me the bag if I win.
    Viviana : Ugh you’re so annoying! Fine but you’re not gonna win! 
    <<set $minigame_won to false>>
    <<start_minigame MinigameManager "marbles">>
    <<set_phase "end">>
<<else>>
    Viviana : Ha! I knew I was faster!
    Viviana : Let’s play again! You’re so bad.
    <<set $minigame_won to false>>
    <<start_minigame MinigameManager "marbles">>
<<endif>>
<<jump Viviana_Bully_End>>
===

title: Viviana_Bully_End
---
<<set_phase "end">>
<<set_phase_for "Grace" "end">>
Viviana : Ugh fine you’re not fun.
Viviana : Just take the dumb marbles I don’t want them anyways.
===

title: Grace_Victim_Start
---
Grace : sniffle
-> Lola : Um… Are you okay? 
    Grace : sniffle… sniffle
    Grace : no
    *She looks up at you*
Lola: What happened? Are you crying? 
Grace: *mumbles* it’s um mu uh
Lola: What? 
Grace : My pixie dust 
Lola : Woah are you a fairy? I love fairies! 
Lola : Silvermist is my favorite! Who’s yours?
Grace : I like Fawn. She has all the animals. 
Lola : Yeah she’s so cool too. Well I can maybe help you find your pixie dust. What does it look like?
Grace : They’re in a Tinkerbell bag and they’re yellow. Some of them are super special too, they're the blue ones. 
Grace : But I didn’t lose them. Viviana has them.
Grace : She keeps saying they got lost.
Grace : And she can’t do anything because it's disappeared
Grace : But I keep seeing her playing with them! She just keeps hiding them from me.
Lola : What! That’s so mean. 
<<jump Grace_Victim_Questions>>
===

title: Grace_Victim_Questions
---
-> Lola : A boy took my bunny today too
    Grace : Who was it?
    Lola : I don’t know him. He had brown hair and a stupid skull shirt. 
    Grace : Oh hmm… I think that’s James
    Grace : He takes stuff all the time!! Everyone knows him. 
    Grace : He calls himself King of the playground. 
    Lola : Do you know where he is? 
    Grace : He’s always in that big tower. Hmm I can draw a map for you. 
    Grace : Just come back and I’ll give it to you.
    Lola: I can go get your pixie dust! We can trade. 
    <<set $knows_james_name to true>>
-> Lola : Maybe I can pretend to play with her and steal them back for you!
    Grace : Woah you can do that? 
    Lola : For a fellow fairy! I will find Viviana and get your pixie dust.
    Grace: Wowowow thank you. I think she’s in the sandbox. 
===

title: Grace_Victim_End
---
Grace : Wait, is that..
Lola : Yup! I got your pixie dust back!
Grace : Wowowow! Oh my gosh
Grace : How did you do that?
Lola : I played a game with Viviana.
Grace : You won? Viviana hates losing.
Grace : Wowowow! Let’s be fairy friends 
*Grace hands you a marble*
Grace : Here! You can keep this one!
Lola : Really? 
Grace : Yeah! It's a powerful blue one! 
Lola : Wow, it's so cool! Thank you
<<if $knows_james_name>>
    Grace: Oh here’s your map! I drew the other parts of the park too. 
    Grace: Some kids here might help you get to James.
    Grace: It’s hard to get to his Tower if you don’t get his attention first.
    Grace: He’s got some dumb guards around. I don’t know why they play with him. They’re mean too. 
    Grace: The only way to him is from them. Like Viviana. I’m sure she told him. She hates losing. 
    Lola: Ok got it! Thank you for the map!
<<else>>
    Lola: I’m definitely going to need some power if I want to get my bunny back.
    Grace: Did you get your bunny stolen too?
    Lola: Yeah at school some stupid boy took him.
    Grace : Who was it?
    Lola : I don’t know. He had brown hair and a stupid skull shirt. 
    Grace : I think that’s James
    Grace : He takes stuff all the time!! Everyone knows him. 
    Grace : He calls himself King of the playground. 
    Lola : Do you know where he is? 
    Grace : He’s always in that big tower. Hmm I can draw a map for you. 
    *hands you map*
    Grace: I drew the other parts of the park too. 
    Grace: Some kids here might help you get to James.
    Grace: It’s hard to get to his Tower if you don’t get his attention first.
    Grace: He’s got some dumb guards around. I don’t know why they play with him. They’re mean too. 
    Grace: The only way to him is from them. Like Viviana. I’m sure she told him. She hates losing. 
    Lola: Ok got it! Thank you for the map!
<<endif>>
===

title: Daisy_Victim_Start
---
Lola : Oh hello! Is that Harry Potter?
Daisy : Yes I love this book. Hermione is my favourite! She’s smart like me.
Lola : I watched the movie. I liked that they had magic. 
Lola: Have you read the Magic Tree House books, those are my favorite.
Daisy : Oh My Gosh, I love that series, it's splendid! 
Daisy : You would love the Harry Potter books then! Trust me they’re so much better than the movies.
Lola : I tried but I don’t think I’m that good at reading yet. 
Daisy: Why don’t you sit next to me and we can read it together!
Daisy: Just tell me if there’s words you don’t know. 
(Lola sits down next to Daisy)
*You sit next Daisy, you notice a boy on the swing would keep staring towards your area, but you notice its not directly to you, but rather to Daisy*
Lola: Um I think that boy is staring at us.
Daisy : Don’t mind him.. 
Lola : Why? Who is that?
Daisy : That's Kevin, we’re in the same class.
Daisy : He’s always glancing at me in class.
Daisy : I don’t understand him, really, and he never says anything nice to me either!
Lola : Oh.. What does he say to you?
Daisy : He says I'm terrible at writing! Mrs. Hampton literally tells me I’m the best writer in the class, like is he making stuff up? I don’t get it!
Lola : He's just mean, don’t listen to him.
Daisy : Ugh, it annoys me so much..
<<jump Daisy_Victim_Questions>> 
===

title: Daisy_Victim_Questions
---
-> Lola : What part of the book is your favorite? <<if not $asked_daisy_book>>
    <<set $asked_daisy_book to true>>
    Daisy : When Hermione saves Harry and Ron from the Devil’s Snare! 
    Daisy : They would’ve been so dead if it weren’t for her smart thinking. 
    Lola : Yeah I remember watching that part, it was satisfying.
    Daisy : Right! She’s always helping get out of trouble.
    <<jump Daisy_Victim_Questions>> 
-> Lola : Do you want me to talk to Kevin?
    Daisy : Sure? I mean if you want yeah
    Daisy : I want to know why he's treating me this way
    Daisy : But I don’t know if I could ask
    Lola : Okay. I'll ask.
    Daisy : Thanks, Lola!
===

title: Daisy_Victim_End
---
<<if $kevin_won>>
    <<jump Daisy_Victim_End_Won>>
<<else>>
    <<jump Daisy_Victim_End_Lost>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Daisy_Victim_End_Won
---
*You and Kevin walk towards Lola, she looks up from reading her book*
Lola : Hey Daisy, Kevin has something for you
*Daisy glances at you, then glances at Kevin*
Kevin : Uh… hey..
Daisy : Hi.. Kevin..?
*He holds out his paper and hands it towards Daisy, his face flushed red*
Daisy : “You are splendid!”
Daisy : Aw! Thank you Kevin!
Kevin : Sorry for being mean to you
Daisy : It's okay
Daisy : Sorry, I told Lola you weren’t a nice person
Kevin : It's okay
Daisy : Do you want to read Harry Potter with me?
Kevin : Oh.. I think its okay, too many big words
Daisy : That's ok! I can read it to you
Kevin : Okay..
*Kevin sits next to Daisy. Daisy reads aloud towards Kevin*
===

title: Daisy_Victim_End_Lost
---
Daisy: Oh hey how’d that go? Isn’t he just unbearable?
Lola: I think he likes you.
Daisy: Haha yeah right. Kevin? Ew. 
===

title: Kevin_Bully_Start
---
*Kevin notices you approaching him by the swing, he scrambles to open his book and stares at it as you come his way*
Kevin : *Ahem*
Lola: Hey what are you doing? Why are you staring at Daisy?
Kevin : What no it not! I’m just sitting.
Kevin : She's right in front of me anyway. I have nothing else to do.
Lola : But like why are you looking at her?
Kevin : Uhmm.
Kevin : I don’t know?
Kevin : She's right in front of me like I said..
Lola : You can move, you know..
Kevin : umm..
Kevin : mm
Kevin : Did Daisy say anything about me? You guys were talking about me right?
Lola : Kevin.. I don’t know.. 
Kevin : How do you know my name? It was Daisy who told you right? I knew she was talking about me.
Lola : Yeah she told me your name, I’m Lola.
Kevin : Oh okay
Kevin : uhhmm
Kevin : I'm just sitting here reading my book. 
Kevin : Yup I am just reading. Reading so much… not doing anything else.
<<jump Kevin_Bully_Questions>> 
===

title: Kevin_Bully_Questions
---
-> Lola : So what were you reading? <<if not $asked_kevin_writing>>
    <<set $asked_kevin_writing to true>>
    Kevin : A story…
    Kevin : Pete the Cat.
    Lola : Aw cute.
    Kevin : What! Not cute, it's a book and it’s not kiddy for my age!
    Kevin : Everyone is already at a reading level of J, I’m not, but reading those older kid books is so annoying, what's with all the words?
    Lola : Yeah big words are hard. I’m not that good too. 
    Lola: Can I try to help you? Daisy was helping me read Harry Potter with her.
    Kevin: D-daisy? Of course she would help you. She's nice to everyone.
    Lola: You know I’m sure Daisy could help you too.
    Kevin: No way! That’s too embarrassing. You help me.
    <<set $minigame_won to false>>
    <<start_minigame MinigameManager "word">>
-> Lola : Do you know James?
    Kevin : Yeah we’re friends. He helps me all the time.
    Lola : Really how?
    Kevin : He said if you’re mean you get attention. 
    Kevin : He does it all the time so his parents have to pay attention to him.
    Lola: Oh. Um, does that work?
    Kevin: Yeah if I’m mean enough Daisy talks to me. 
    Lola: You know she would talk to you more if you’re nice. 
    Lola: She was talking to me about her book. Maybe you can ask her about it too.
    Kevin: No I’m not good at reading.
    Lola: You know I’m sure Daisy could help you.
    Kevin: No way! That’s too embarrassing. You help me. Then maybe I’ll ask her. 
    <<set $minigame_won to false>>
    <<start_minigame MinigameManager "word">>
-> Lola : Why are you mean to Daisy? 
    Kevin: Cause being mean gets attention duh?
    Lola: Huh? Who told you that?
    Kevin: James did. He said if you’re mean you get attention. 
    Kevin : He does it all the time so his parents have to pay attention to him.
    Lola: Oh. Well I don’t think it’s working on Daisy. She doesn’t like you.
    Kevin: What! Did she say that to you? 
    Kevin: I mean I don’t care. It’s not like I like-like her or anything. 
    Lola: Sure you don't. You know she loves reading. Maybe you could write her something to get her attention?
    Kevin: Fine but you have to help me write it.
    <<set $minigame_won to false>>
    <<start_minigame MinigameManager "word">>
<<jump Kevin_Bully_Midpoint>>
===

