title: Kevin_Bully_Midpoint_Lost
---
Kevin : Uhhhhhhhmm..
Kevin : A... C... T...
Kevin : Taac?
Kevin : This game is broken!
Kevin : The letters are wrong!
Kevin: I can’t do it. Daisy is never going to like me.
Lola : They're just mixed up.
Lola : Try the first letter again.
<<set $minigame_won to false>>
<<start_minigame MinigameManager "word2">>
<<jump Kevin_Bully_End>>
