title: Kevin_Bully_End_Won
---
Kevin : WOAH! 
Kevin : I DID IT! 
Kevin : I READ IT!
Lola : You did! 
Kevin : Wait! I’m the best..
Lola : You should write something for Daisy.
Kevin : Like what?
Lola : What do you like about her?
Kevin : She has a big book.
Kevin : She says "splendid."
Lola : Write that.
*Kevin writes slowly. He holds up the paper.*
Kevin : "You are splindit."
Lola : Almost. It's "You are  s p l e n d i d “
Kevin : Oh.
Lola : It’s okay almost there.
Kevin : Will you give it to her?
Lola: You should give it to her.
Kevin : Ummm. I'm nervous.
Lola : I'll walk with you.
===

title: Kevin_Bully_End_Lost
---
Kevin: This is stupid. What’s the point?
Kevin: Being mean works you don’t know stupid.
Kevin: James was right, be nice gets you nowhere. 
===

title: Andy_Victim_Start
---
*Andy sits on the ground, the grass surrounding him, his gaze seemingly stares off into space. You notice him holding a lollipop stick, the plastic still stuck to the candy, and a frog book is open in front of him*
Lola : Hi, what are you reading?
Andy : I’m reading about frogs! They’re so cool! Did you know there’s poisonous ones? I wish I was poisonous!
Lola: Why do you want to be poisonous?
Andy: So that I could make Diana finally shut up.
Andy : She's really loud, I don’t like it. Her screams hurt my ears and I’m not even near her.
Andy : She’s always playing with the other kids. It’s not fair.
Lola: Why’s that not fair? Don’t you play with other kids?
Andy: I try playing with her. But she just screams “Nerrrrrrrrd!”
Lola: Well are you a nerd? 
Andy : I saw her trying to do math, I went behind her and and told her the answers. But that doesn’t make me a nerd!
Lola : Is she good at math?
Andy : No, that's why I was trying to help her. But now she just calls me a nerd and it’s so annoying.
-> Lola :  I don’t think you should have done that
    Andy : Fudge. Really? Dang it, why did I do that?
    Lola : It's ok.. she was probably just upset that you called her dumb. 
    Andy: What! I didn’t say that to her.
    Lola: Well yeah you told her the answer. That’s basically calling her dumb.
Andy : Can you talk to Diana with me? I wasn’t trying to say she was dumb.
Andy : But I don’t think she’ll listen to me and I don’t want to hear her say nerd again.
Lola: I’ll go with you. But let me talk to her first.
===

