title: Diana_Bully_Start
---
Diana : Hi! I like your hair. Do you want to play with me?
Lola : Hi! Sure I’ll play with you.
Diana: What’s your name? I’m Diana! Let’s go play on the slide.
Lola: I’m Lola! And I like your hair too. 
-> Lola : Do you know Andy?
    Diana: Yeah I know him. He’s a nerrrrrd. 
    Lola: Why’d you call him a nerd? 
    Diana: Cause he is one. He’s so smart. I wish I was that smart.
    Lola: You know he could help you be smart. I can help you too!
    Diana: No Andy doesn’t like me. He runs away every time I talk to him.
    Lola: It’s probably cause you call him a nerd.
    Andy: Um hi Diana…
    Diana: Hi nerrrrrd. Oh shoot um… Not nerd? 
    Andy: Don’t call me that I don’t like it. 
    Diana: Is nerd bad? Don’t you want to be smart? I don’t get it.
    Andy: When you say it, it’s mean! Stop!
    Andy: If I help you will you just stop calling me that. 
    Lola: Yeah we can help you! But you have to promise to stop calling Andy a nerd. 
    Diana: Ok fine make me smart. Help me with this question. 
    <<set $minigame_won to false>>
    <<start_minigame MinigameManager "counting">>
-> Lola : I heard you call Andy a nerd.
    Diana: Well yeah he is one. He’s always reading and knows all the answers.
    Lola: Do you not like Andy? 
    Diana: I like Andy. Wait not like, like-like him. He’s just a nerd. I wish I was a nerd. 
    Lola: Wait, you wish you were a nerd?
    Diana: Yeah I’m not good at math. I want to be smart like him cause he’s a nerrrrrd.
    Andy: Um hi Diana…
    Diana: Hi nerrrrrrrrd!
    Lola: Stop calling him that! He doesn’t like it. 
    Diana: Is nerd bad? Don’t you want to be smart? I don’t get it.
    Andy: When you say it, it’s mean! Stop!
    Andy: If I help you will you just stop calling me that. 
    Lola: Yeah we can help you! But you have to promise to stop calling Andy a nerd. 
    Diana: Ok fine make me smart. Help me with this question. 
    <<set $minigame_won to false>>
