title: Evan_Victim_Questions
---
-> Ask about Daniel
    Evan: Oh I forgot you’re new here. Daniel is just another jerk. He finds it funny to steal things because he can. 
    Evan: He’s always giving our stuff to James. Other jerks do it too but Daniel steals the most. 
    Evan: That's why he and James are best friends. Two jerks in a jerky sandwich. 
-> Ask about lunch box
    Evan: It’s my limited edition Ninja Turtles lunch box. Dad said it was the last one left and I couldn’t lose it this time.
    Lola: This time? How many times have you lost your lunch box?
    Evan: Well I had Spiderman, then Transformers, then Scooby Doo. 
    Lola: What happened to them?
    Evan: Daniel, Kevin, and Viviana. I guess Daniel wanted an extra point….
-> Ask about James
    Lola: Is James mean to everyone? He stole my bunny in school today.
    Evan: Yeah he’s the biggest jerk. Was your bunny a limited edition item too? My lunch box was.
    Lola: It was from my mom. From before she was gone. (lola looks away sad)
    Evan: Oh sorry. Then you have to get it back! Talk to Daniel, he’s mean but he will get you closer to James. 
