title: Daniel_Bully_Questions
---
-> Lola : Take me to James
    Daniel: Why can you cry like a baby for your stuffie?
    Lola: Shut up! I’m not a baby. 
    Daniel: That’s what a baby would say. Cry baby haha. 
    Daniel: Even if I take you to him you’d just cry your way home. 
    Lola: Not true! You’re a cry baby!
    Daniel: Me? HA! Yeah right I bet I could beat you in an arm wrestle right now and you’d cry. 
    Lola: Bring it! And if you lose you have to give me back Evan’s lunch box.
    Daniel: Deal!
    <<set $minigame_won to false>>
    <<start_minigame MinigameManager "arm">>
-> Lola : Give me back Evan’s lunch box
    Daniel: Evan? You mean Wheezie? HA! Did he send you up here cause he couldn’t climb up himself.
    Lola: You pushed him! 
    Daniel: No I didn’t. He pushed himself, it’s Wheezie.
    Lola: Well you have to give it back!
    Daniel: Says who? Wanna bet?
    Lola: If I beat you in an arm wrestle then you have to give his lunch box back.
    Daniel: Oh you’re on, heck yeah. You’re going down cry baby. 
    <<set $minigame_won to false>>
    <<start_minigame MinigameManager "arm">>
<<jump Daniel_Bully_Midpoint>>
===

