title: Ellie_Victim_Start
---
*Plushies sit on the roundabout, teapots sit in front, Ellie pushes the roundabout and hums a familiar tune*
Lola : Is that a tea party?
Ellie : Oh my gosh, hello! Wanna join my tea party?
Ellie : Do you have a plushie with you? 
Ellie : Wanna be friends??
Lola : Yeah.. I had a plushie, but James stole him from me..
Ellie : ?!!
Ellie : That's okay! Do you still want to join my tea party?
Lola : Oh sure what part are you on?
Ellie: Lady Sprinkles is having her royal tea party with all of the other princesses but now her knight is here! Here, that’s you!
*Lola picks up the mouse plushie that Ellie hands her*
Mouse Knight: Hello my queen! I have returned.
Lady Sprinkles: Ah my knight! Have you brought back the pastries I requested?
Mouse Knight: Yes I have here you go! 
Lady Sprinkles: Mmm yummy. How tasty! Princesses, you must try these cupcakes. 
Lady Sprinkles: Princess Bear stop looking at my knight! He’s cute but he’s mine!
Princess Bear: That’s too bad! Because me and the knight are in love!
Mouse Knight: It’s true! I’m sorry my queen!
Lady Sprinkles: How dare you betray me! You are not my loyal knight anymore! Leave, both of you!
*Mouse Knight and Princess Bear are thrown off of the roundabout*
Ellie: Hahaha! That was so silly. You’re more fun to play with than Sammy.
Lola: Who’s Sammy?
Ellie: I don’t know some girl. I gave her my tiger plushie. That one was old and didn’t fit my tea party anyways.
Ellie: She seemed upset or whatever I don’t know. But she was running the tea party.
Ellie: You made it fun again. Mouse Knight would totally be in love with Princess Bear. 
*Ellie goes back to playing in her tea party*
===

title: Ellie_Victim_End
---
She’s in her own world. You can hear her voice the princesses in a very dramatic fashion.
===

title: Sammy_Bully_Start
---
*You go up to Sammy, she's trying her best to use the kiddie needles to fix the tiger plushie, but fails with every attempt, you watch Sammy as she goes through the motions before approaching her*
Lola : Hi! Do you want me to help you with that? My dad told me how to sew.
*Sammy gives you a questionable confused look, then one that reveals a hint of guilt*
Sammy : I need to fix this myself! I broke it! It’s almo- Ugh!!
Lola : I, The Mouse Knight!! Shall fix this plushie for you!
Lola : Huzzah!~
Lola : I, The Mouse Knight, have seen many plushies in need of help. It is my duty to fix these plushies!
Sammy : Um..
Sammy : I don’t think a Mouse Knight would say “Huzzah”..
*A quiet chuckle leaves Sammy, but you see her face going back into guilt*  
Sammy : Ugh.. If I don’t fix this plushie James is going to be so mad.
Lola: James? Does he want your plushie too? 
Sammy: Oh um forget I said anything. It’s nothing. 
Lola : Can I try fixing it for you?
Sammy : No! If I can’t even fix a plushie myself I suck.
Lola : My dad says you never suck! You’re just learning. 
Lola: I can show you. I’m good at sewing now. 
Sammy : Mm. ok… thank you…
<<set $minigame_won to false>>
<<start_minigame MinigameManager "sewing">>
<<jump Sammy_Bully_Midpoint>>
===

