title: Sammy_Bully_End_Won
---
Sammy: Oh my gosh thank you! Thank you! 
Lola: Because I fixed it you have to answer a question now
-> Lola: Why does James want the plushie?
    Sammy: He said I had to give him two things…it was a dumb deal 
    Sammy: He took my Cloudy from me and wouldn’t give it back. He said if I wanted it I had to prove I wasn’t a baby anymore.
    Sammy: He told me to steal but maybe I am just a baby. I couldn’t do it, Ellie had to give me a plushie.
    Sammy: I really do suck. 
    -> Comfort Sammy
        Lola: I think you’re really brave! He took my plushie too and said I was a baby.
        Lola: Does it matter that you didn’t steal it? You still got a plushie that counts!
        Sammy: I stole the first one…. I took Isabelle’s keychain
        Sammy: She was so upset and Ms. Mallory had everyone look for it in the classroom.
        Sammy: I felt so bad. She was crying and everything.
        Sammy: I put it back on her desk after recess. I found this hairclip in the stairs instead.
        Sammy: But thanks Lola. At least I have Tiger now too.
    -> Ask why James steals things
        Lola: He stole my plushie too! Does he take everyone’s things? Why? That’s so unfair.
        Sammy: He didn’t always. I used to live next to him. 
        Sammy: His siblings would take everything from him when we played together. He was the baby and got a lot of stuff from his parents.
        Sammy: But I think there’s a new baby now. He doesn’t get anything anymore.
-> Lola: How did the plushie break?
    Sammy: I was trying to put the tiger in my bag but it got stuck on the zipper and ripped.
    Sammy: My mom gave me this kit for just in case but I forgot how to use it. 
    Sammy: Nothing has been going good today! I just want to go home. 
    -> Comfort Sammy
        Lola: Hey don’t cry! Look it’s fixed now 
        Tiger: Hello Sammy! I’m all better now roar roar 
        Sammy: Thank you Lola… sniffle..
    -> What do you need the plushie for?
        Sammy: I made a dumb deal with James. He wants two stolen things if I want my Cloudy back. I had to prove I’m not just a little baby.
        Sammy: He told me to steal but maybe I am just a baby. I couldn’t do it, Ellie had to give me a plushie.
        Sammy: I really do suck. 
        Sammy: But thanks Lola. At least I have Tiger now.
===

